  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Harare Metro and Midlands Provinces WASH Emergency Response Programme &#x2013; Standby</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This is a Standby contingency project that aims at reducing morbidity and mortality caused by the diarrhoea diseases through provision of Water Sanitation and Hygiene (WASH) services to the people affected by emergencies, agreed between Oxfam and United Nations Children&apos;s Fund (UNICEF) to be activated in case of an emergency.  The main focus of activities through this Programme Cooperation Agreement (PCA) will be the provision of a joint response to WASH emergency services for up to 200,000 people and for duration of up to 180 days of the emergency.</narrative>
  </description>
